    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Convert to PDF\n\nResource PDF Operation, operation Convert to PDF.\n\nBase64 Encoded File: `{{ $json.documentBase64 }}`\nFile Type: `docx`, must match the real file.\n\nReturns the PDF as Base64 in `body`.",
