    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Merge files into one PDF\n\n**Before running:** set your credential on every Cloud Office Print, Google Drive and Google Sheets node, one by one. n8n does not copy credentials across imported nodes. Then pick your own files in the empty File and Document fields.\n\nDownloads two files from Drive, merges them into a single PDF in order, and uploads the result.\n\nThe Files field is a fixed list, so each file needs its own entry and its own Base64 value. That is why there are two download and Base64 pairs. Office files and images are converted to PDF before being appended.\n\n### Setup\nUpload `docs/assets/samples/invoice-2024-001.pdf` and `sample-document.docx` to your Drive.",
        "height": 433,
        "width": 2220,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
